# Binaries and build output
bin/
dist/
*.exe
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out

# `go build ./...` from the repo root writes one bare, extension-less binary
# per scripts/<name> main package straight into this directory (migrate,
# batchgen, loadgen). Explicit names, not a wildcard, so a real file that
# happens to share a script's name is never silently ignored.
# docs/INCIDENTS.md 2026-09-03: /migrate has been committed since the very
# first commit that added it, undetected until now, this list stops that
# from repeating for the newer tools.
/migrate
/batchgen
/loadgen

# Go
vendor/
go.work
go.work.sum

# Secrets and local config
.env
.env.local
*.pem
*.key

# Node (web/)
node_modules/
.next/
build/
.vite/

# Editor and OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
*.swp

# Local infra state
tmp/
*.log

# Rendered from prometheus.yml.tmpl by `make up-observability`, machine-
# specific (docs/DECISIONS.md HOST_IP override).
deploy/observability/prometheus.generated.yml

# NOTE: proto/gen/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
# Generated Go code is committed so every agent builds without a
# matching protoc/buf toolchain. See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md section 9.

# Vite local env overrides
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Local agent tooling. Agent definitions are local-only by choice: they are
# tooling, not project knowledge. What was built and why lives in docs/.
.claude/

# Logs from `make demo-up` (docs/INCIDENTS.md 2026-08-31)
.demo-logs/

# Local working notes from the docs audit, deliberately not published.
AUDIT_FINDINGS.md
